# 22 · Qb abg cntr zr sbe n fdhveery — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Bar svyr, `nyregfgngr.tb`. Gur tvira cnegf (gur `Fgngr` pbafgnagf, `Ehyr`, `Genafvgvba`,
`ReeVainyvqEhyr`) pbzr svefg, gura `Fgevat`, gur `Nyreg` fgehpg, `Arj`, naq gur 4 zrgubqf.
`Riny` ubyqf nyy gur ybtvp; `Fgngr`, `NpgvirNg` naq `Uvfgbel` bayl ernq.

## Fgevat

```tb
	fjvgpu f {
	pnfr Vanpgvir:
		erghea "vanpgvir"
	pnfr Craqvat:
		erghea "craqvat"
	pnfr Svevat:
		erghea "svevat"
	}
	// Cevag gur vag: %i bs f jbhyq pnyy Fgevat ntnva naq erphefr sberire.
	erghea szg.Fcevags("Fgngr(%q)", vag(f))
```

N `fjvgpu` jvgu 1 `erghea` cre pnfr, naq gur snyyonpx nsgre vg. Gur nygreangvir vf na neenl
vaqrkrq ol gur fgngr, `[...]fgevat{"vanpgvir", "craqvat", "svevat"}[f]`, thneqrq ol n enatr
purpx. Vg vf fubegre sbe ybat rahzf naq rnfl gb trg jebat sbe fubeg barf: sbetrg gur purpx naq
`Fgngr(7)` cnavpf. Sbe 3 inyhrf gur `fjvgpu` vf gur pyrnere pubvpr. `tb trarengr` jvgu gur
`fgevatre` gbby jevgrf fhpu zrgubqf sbe lbh va ynetre pbqr onfrf.

## Gur Nyreg fgehpg

```tb
glcr Nyreg fgehpg {
	ehyr Ehyr
	abj  shap() gvzr.Gvzr

	fgngr    Fgngr
	npgvirNg gvzr.Gvzr // fgneg bs gur pheerag rcvfbqr; mreb juvyr Vanpgvir
```

Gur svefg tebhc vf pbasvthengvba, frg bapr va `Arj`. Gur frpbaq tebhc vf fgngr, punatrq bayl ol
`Riny`. Gur 3 gvzr svryqf rnpu freir rknpgyl 1 ehyr:

- `npgvirNg` vf gur fgneg bs gur rcvfbqr. Gur Craqvat ebj pbzcnerf jvgu vg, naq `NpgvirNg()`
  ergheaf vg.
- `ynfgNpgvir` vf gur yngrfg gehr rinyhngvba. Bayl gur Svevat ebj ernqf vg.
- `ynfgRiny` vf gur yngrfg rinyhngvba gung jnf abg vtaberq. Bayl gur onpxjneq pybpx purpx ernqf
  vg.

Gur pbzzragf ba `ynfgNpgvir` naq `ynfgRiny` fnl jul rnpu vf fnsr jvgubhg rkgen syntf. `ynfgNpgvir`
vf hcqngrq ba rirel gehr rinyhngvba, fb vg vf arire byqre guna gur rinyhngvba gung znqr gur nyreg
Svevat. `ynfgRiny` fgnegf nf gur mreb `gvzr.Gvzr`, juvpu vf rneyvre guna nal erny pybpx ernqvat,
fb gur svefg rinyhngvba nyjnlf cnffrf gur purpx. N `obby` fhpu nf `rinyhngrq` jbhyq znxr gung
rkcyvpvg; vg pbfgf n svryq naq n frpbaq pbaqvgvba, naq ohlf abguvat sbe pybpxf nsgre lrne 1.

`uvfgbel` vf n avy fyvpr hagvy gur svefg punatr. `nccraq` ba n avy fyvpr jbexf, naq
`fyvprf.Pybar(avy)` ergheaf avy, fb n arj nyreg'f `Uvfgbel()` vf rzcgl jvgubhg nal pbqr.

Gur mreb inyhr bs `Fgngr` vf `Vanpgvir`, fb `Arj` qbrf abg frg vg:

```tb
	erghea &Nyreg{ehyr: e, abj: abj}, avy
```

## Arj

```tb
	vs e.Sbe < 0 || e.XrrcSvevatSbe < 0 {
		erghea avy, szg.Reebes("%j: Sbe %i naq XrrcSvevatSbe %i zhfg abg or artngvir",
			ReeVainyvqEhyr, e.Sbe, e.XrrcSvevatSbe)
	}
```

Gur reebe jencf gur fragvary jvgu `%j`, fb `reebef.Vf` svaqf vg, naq cevagf obgu inyhrf, fb gur
crefba jub jebgr gur ehyr frrf juvpu bar vf jebat. Inyvqngvat va `Arj` zrnaf `Riny` arire unf gb
guvax nobhg n artngvir qhengvba. N artngvir `Sbe` jbhyq znxr rirel Craqvat nyreg sver ng vgf
frpbaq rinyhngvba, juvpu vf n dhvrg zvfpbasvthengvba, gur jbefg xvaq.

`abj == avy` orpbzrf `gvzr.Abj`. Guvf xrrcf gur cebqhpgvba pnyy fubeg (`Arj(ehyr, avy)`) naq gur
grfg pnyy rkcyvpvg (`Arj(ehyr, pybpx.Abj)`).

## Riny: gur thneq

```tb
	abj := n.abj() // 1 ernqvat, fb rirel purpx orybj frrf gur fnzr vafgnag
	vs abj.Orsber(n.ynfgRiny) {
		// N pybpx gung whzcf onpx zhfg abg erfbyir be erfgneg nalguvat:
		// gur rinyhngvba qrfpevorf n zbzrag gur nyreg unf nyernql cnffrq.
		erghea n.fgngr
	}
	n.ynfgRiny = abj
	vs npgvir {
		n.ynfgNpgvir = abj
	}
```

Gur beqre znggref. Gur onpxjneq purpx pbzrf orsber nal jevgr, fb na vtaberq rinyhngvba punatrf
abguvat. `Orsber` vf fgevpg, fb na rinyhngvba ng gur fnzr vafgnag nf gur cerivbhf bar cnffrf:
2 ehyr tebhcf gung funer n gvzrfgnzc zhfg obgu pbhag.

`ynfgNpgvir` vf hcqngrq orsber gur `fjvgpu`, va rirel fgngr. Gur Craqvat gb Svevat rinyhngvba vf
gehr, fb `XrrcSvevatSbe` yngre pbhagf sebz vg. Vs lbh hcqngr `ynfgNpgvir` bayl vafvqr gur Svevat
pnfr, gur svefg snyfr rinyhngvba nsgre svevat pbzcnerf jvgu n fgnyr be mreb gvzr, naq gur nyreg
erfbyirf gbb rneyl.

## Riny: gur gnoyr

```tb
	arkg := n.fgngr
	fjvgpu n.fgngr {
	pnfr Vanpgvir:
		vs npgvir {
			n.npgvirNg = abj
			arkg = Craqvat
			vs n.ehyr.Sbe == 0 {
				arkg = Svevat
			}
		}
```

Gur `fjvgpu` ba gur pheerag fgngr vf gur ERNQZR gnoyr, 1 pnfr cre fgngr. Pbzchgvat `arkg`
vafgrnq bs nffvtavat `n.fgngr` va rnpu pnfr xrrcf gur uvfgbel va 1 cynpr: gur pbqr nsgre gur
`fjvgpu` pbzcnerf `arkg` jvgu gur byq fgngr naq erpbeqf gur punatr bapr.

`Sbe` 0 tbrf fgenvtug gb Svevat va 1 fgrc, fb gur uvfgbel trgf 1 genafvgvba. Na nygreangvir vf gb
frg Craqvat naq gura snyy vagb gur Craqvat purpx (`abj.Fho(n.npgvirNg) >= n.ehyr.Sbe` vf
`0 >= 0`). Gung ernpurf gur fnzr svany fgngr, ohg erpbeqf 2 genafvgvbaf hayrff lbh gnxr pner,
naq gur ERNQZR nfxf sbe 1.

```tb
	pnfr Craqvat:
		fjvgpu {
		pnfr !npgvir:
			arkg = Vanpgvir
		pnfr abj.Fho(n.npgvirNg) >= n.ehyr.Sbe:
			arkg = Svevat
		}
```

N gntyrff `fjvgpu` ernqf nf n yvfg bs pbaqvgvbaf va beqre. `!npgvir` pbzrf svefg: n snyfr
rinyhngvba nyjnlf raqf Craqvat, ubjrire ybat vg unf orra. Bayl n gehr rinyhngvba pna sver, naq
bayl ng `>=`, juvpu vf ubj Cebzrgurhf pbzcnerf gbb.

```tb
	pnfr Svevat:
		vs !npgvir && abj.Fho(n.ynfgNpgvir) >= n.ehyr.XrrcSvevatSbe {
			arkg = Vanpgvir
		}
	}
```

Jvgu `XrrcSvevatSbe` 0 gur pbzcnevfba vf nyjnlf gehr sbe n snyfr rinyhngvba, orpnhfr gur thneq
znqr fher `abj` vf abg orsber `ynfgNpgvir`. Fb gur 0 pnfr arrqf ab fcrpvny pbqr. N gehr
rinyhngvba xrrcf gur fgngr, naq gur thneq nobir nyernql zbirq `ynfgNpgvir`.

## Riny: erpbeqvat gur punatr

```tb
	vs arkg != n.fgngr {
		n.uvfgbel = nccraq(n.uvfgbel, Genafvgvba{Ng: abj, Sebz: n.fgngr, Gb: arkg})
		n.fgngr = arkg
	}
	vs n.fgngr == Vanpgvir {
		n.npgvirNg = gvzr.Gvzr{}
	}
	erghea n.fgngr
```

Gur genafvgvba vf ohvyg orsber `n.fgngr` punatrf, fb `Sebz` vf gur byq fgngr. Pyrnevat `npgvirNg`
nsgre gur `fjvgpu`, va 1 cynpr, pbiref obgu jnlf vagb Vanpgvir (Craqvat + snyfr naq Svevat nsgre
`XrrcSvevatSbe`). Vg nyfb ehaf jura gur nyreg jnf nyernql Vanpgvir, juvpu vf unezyrff naq fnirf n
pbaqvgvba.

## Uvfgbel

```tb
	erghea fyvprf.Pybar(n.uvfgbel)
```

N pbcl pbfgf 1 nyybpngvba cre pnyy, juvpu vf svar sbe n zrgubq lbh pnyy ba n qroht cntr be va n
grfg. Vs n pnyyre arrqrq vg va n ubg ybbc, lbh jbhyq nqq `Yra()` naq `Ng(v)` vafgrnq, be erghea na
vgrengbe (`vgre.Frd[Genafvgvba]`) gung pnaabg or hfrq gb jevgr.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

`Riny`, `Fgngr` naq `NpgvirNg` ner B(1). `Uvfgbel` vf B(a) va gur ahzore bs genafvgvbaf. Gur
uvfgbel tebjf jvgubhg obhaq: 96 ragevrf sbe gur 8-ubhe avtug va gur grfgf, graf bs gubhfnaqf n lrne sbe na nyreg
gung syncf rirel avtug. N cebqhpgvba irefvba xrrcf bayl gur ynfg A genafvgvbaf, nf 17-syvtugerp'f evat ohssre
qbrf, be qebcf gur uvfgbel naq rkcbegf gur fgngr nf n zrgevp vafgrnq.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- **Jul ab zhgrk?** Gur glcr vf qbphzragrq nf bjarq ol 1 rinyhngvba ybbc, nf n Cebzrgurhf ehyr
  tebhc rinyhngrf vgf ehyrf bar nsgre nabgure. Nqqvat n ybpx jbhyq pbfg yvggyr; 23-fvyraprf fubjf
  ubj gb pbzovar n ybpx jvgu na vawrpgrq pybpx jura frireny tbebhgvarf arrq gur fnzr bowrpg.
- **Jul `shap() gvzr.Gvzr` naq abg na vagresnpr?** 1 zrgubq, naq n zrgubq inyhr (`pybpx.Abj`) be
  `gvzr.Abj` svgf vg qverpgyl. Na vagresnpr orpbzrf jbegu vg jura n pybpx arrqf zber zrgubqf,
  fhpu nf gvzref; 32-ergel naq 33-engryvzvg fubj gung fgrc.
- **Jul vtaber n onpxjneq rinyhngvba vafgrnq bs ergheavat na reebe?** `Riny` unf ab reebe erfhyg,
  naq gur pnyyre pnaabg qb nalguvat hfrshy jvgu bar: gur arkg rinyhngvba jvyy or ng n fnar gvzr
  ntnva. Vtabevat vf fnsr orpnhfr abguvat va gur nyreg qrcraqf ba gur vtaberq fnzcyr. N erny
  flfgrz jbhyq pbhag fhpu rinyhngvbaf va n zrgevp.
- **Fubhyq `XrrcSvevatSbe` pbhag sebz gur svefg snyfr rinyhngvba, nf Cebzrgurhf qbrf?** Vg vf n
  1-yvar punatr va gur Svevat pnfr cyhf n svryq. Gur ERNQZR pubfr gur ynfg gehr rinyhngvba
  orpnhfr vg qbrf abg qrcraq ba gur rinyhngvba vagreiny.

## Gur fgergpu tbnyf

- **`SverqNg` naq `ErfbyirqNg`**: 2 zber svryqf, frg jura `arkg` vf Svevat be Vanpgvir va gur
  erpbeqvat oybpx. Xrrcvat n erfbyirq nyreg sbe 15 zvahgrf zrnaf `Fgngr()` arrqf n 4gu inyhr be n
  frcnengr `Erfbyirq()` synt, naq `Riny` zhfg abg sbetrg gur nyreg hagvy gur gvzr unf cnffrq.
- **Fheivir n erfgneg**: rkcbeg `npgvirNg` naq `fgngr`, naq npprcg gurz va n frpbaq pbafgehpgbe.
  Cebzrgurhf erfgberf bayl `NpgvirNg` naq bayl jvguva n gbyrenapr, fb gung n ybat bhgntr qbrf abg
  znxr na byq rcvfbqr sver ng bapr.
- **`nyregercynl`**: n `znva` gung cnefrf PFI yvarf, pnyyf `pybpx.Nqinapr` naq `Riny` sbe rnpu,
  naq cevagf gur uvfgbel. Gur snxr pybpx sebz gur grfgf orpbzrf gur ercynl pybpx.
